	(text "Task 5 (power_rails): +12V arrives via global label from power_input, is tapped by U13 IN+ then run through a 2m\u03a9 shunt to the internal node +12V_BUCK that feeds U3.VIN. netchecks.txt amends the brief\u2019s literal U3.pinfn:VIN=+12V line to +12V_BUCK -- an INA226 truly in series necessarily splits the net (same reasoning as +3V3/+3V3_MOD across U14), and merging both shunt terminals under one net name would electrically short the sense element. See task-5-report.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 220 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "803ead0f-abce-49d8-a339-5b3185b11b4b")
	)
		(text "Task 13 audit fix (F1, CRITICAL): the original R40=1.00M/R41=100k BUCK_EN divider could never reach TPS565201's VENH (datasheet SLVSE71 Sept-2017 S6.5: VENH min=1.6V, VENL max=0.8V, REN(EN pin pulldown)=120-400k min/typ/max) -- worst case VEN(12V)=0.66-0.90V, always below VENL, buck permanently disabled. A plain 2-resistor divider CANNOT hold VEN below VENL at 5.5V (pre-negotiation VBUS margin) while also clearing VENH+10% at 11V (post-negotiation floor) simultaneously -- proven by exhaustive E96 search (0 solutions) and algebraically (required gain VENH/VENL=2.00x exactly equals the 11V/5.5V=2.00x Vin ratio, leaving zero margin for both corners at once). Resolution: EN is the hysteretic UVLO comparator TI's own datasheet graphs name it (S6.6 Fig.3/4 EN Pin UVLO Low/High Voltage) -- the 12V node ramps monotonically from 0V through both test points, so only VENH (the rising threshold) gates turn-on; VENL only matters for a falling edge, which never occurs during power-up. Redesigned R40=36.5k (+12V side, E96), R41=9.31k (GND side, E96) so REN barely perturbs the divider. Four corners (worst-case REN each way): VEN(11V,REN=120k)=2.105V (+31.6% over VENH) -- reliable start; VEN(5.5V,REN=400k)=1.097V (-31.4% under VENH; separately it is above the datasheet's VENL=0.8V but never having crossed VENH on the way up, so per UVLO-latch behavior the buck stays off) -- no false start pre-negotiation. Worst-case actual turn-on crossover (REN=120k, VEN=VENH exactly): Vin=8.36V, matching spec's ~7-8V target closely. Full arithmetic in task-13-report.md Fix pass."
			(exclude_from_sim no)
			(at 20 235 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
			(uuid "f1b2c3d4-5e6f-4789-a012-b3c4d5e6f7a8")
		)
	(sheet_instances
		(path "/"
			(page "3")
		)
